{
  "mark.3.p1.b1": {
    "text": "イエスがまた会堂にはいられると、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b2": {
    "text": "そこに片手のなえた人がいた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b3": {
    "text": "人々は…安息日にその人をいやされるかどうかをうかがっていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b4": {
    "text": "イエスを訴えようと思って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b1": {
    "text": "すると、イエスは片手のなえたその人に、…と言い、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b2": {
    "text": "立って、中へ出てきなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b3": {
    "text": "人々にむかって、…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b4": {
    "text": "安息日に善を行うのと悪を行うのと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b5": {
    "text": "命を救うのと殺すのと、どちらがよいか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b6": {
    "text": "彼らは黙っていた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは怒りを含んで彼らを見まわし、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b2": {
    "text": "その心のかたくななのを嘆いて、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b3": {
    "text": "その人に…と言われた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b4": {
    "text": "手を伸ばしなさい",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b5": {
    "text": "そこで手を伸ばすと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b6": {
    "text": "その手は元どおりになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b1": {
    "text": "パリサイ人たちは出て行って、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b2": {
    "text": "すぐにヘロデ党の者たちと、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b3": {
    "text": "なんとかしてイエスを殺そうと相談しはじめた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b1": {
    "text": "それから、イエスは弟子たちと共に海べに退かれたが、ガリラヤからきたおびただしい群衆がついて行った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b2": {
    "text": "またユダヤから、エルサレムから、イドマヤから、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:7-8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b3": {
    "text": "更にヨルダンの向こうから、ツロ、シドンのあたりからも、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b4": {
    "text": "おびただしい群衆が、そのなさっていることを聞いて、みもとにきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p6.b1": {
    "text": "イエスは群衆が自分に押し迫るのを避けるために、小舟を用意しておけと、弟子たちに命じられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p6.b2": {
    "text": "それは、多くの人をいやされたので、病苦に悩む者は皆イエスにさわろうとして、押し寄せてきたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b1": {
    "text": "また、けがれた霊どもはイエスを見るごとに、みまえにひれ伏し、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b2": {
    "text": "叫んで、…と言った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b3": {
    "text": "あなたこそ神の子です",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b4": {
    "text": "イエスは御自身のことを人にあらわさないようにと、彼らをきびしく戒められた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b1": {
    "text": "さてイエスは山に登り、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b2": {
    "text": "みこころにかなった者たちを呼び寄せられたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b3": {
    "text": "彼らはみもとにきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b1": {
    "text": "そこで十二人をお立てになった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b2": {
    "text": "彼らを自分のそばに置くためであり、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b3": {
    "text": "さらに宣教につかわし、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b4": {
    "text": "また悪霊を追い出す権威を持たせるためであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b1": {
    "text": "こうして、この十二人をお立てになった。そしてシモンにペテロという名をつけ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b2": {
    "text": "またゼベダイの子ヤコブと、ヤコブの兄弟ヨハネ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b3": {
    "text": "彼らにはボアネルゲ、すなわち、雷の子という名をつけられた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b1": {
    "text": "つぎにアンデレ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b2": {
    "text": "ピリポ、バルトロマイ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b3": {
    "text": "マタイ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b4": {
    "text": "トマス、アルパヨの子ヤコブ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b5": {
    "text": "タダイ、熱心党のシモン、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b6": {
    "text": "それからイスカリオテのユダ。このユダがイエスを裏切ったのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b1": {
    "text": "イエスが家にはいられると、群衆がまた集まってきたので、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:19-20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b2": {
    "text": "一同は食事をする暇もないほどであった。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b3": {
    "text": "身内の者たちはこの事を聞いて、イエスを取押えに出てきた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b4": {
    "text": "気が狂ったと思ったからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b1": {
    "text": "また、エルサレムから下ってきた律法学者たちも、…と言い、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b2": {
    "text": "彼はベルゼブルにとりつかれている",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b3": {
    "text": "…とも言った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b4": {
    "text": "悪霊どものかしらによって、悪霊どもを追い出しているのだ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b1": {
    "text": "そこでイエスは彼らを呼び寄せ、譬をもって言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b2": {
    "text": "どうして、サタンがサタンを追い出すことができようか。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b3": {
    "text": "もし国が内部で分れ争うなら、その国は立ち行かない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b4": {
    "text": "また、もし家が内わで分れ争うなら、その家は立ち行かないであろう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b1": {
    "text": "もしサタンが内部で対立し分争するなら、彼は立ち行けず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b2": {
    "text": "滅んでしまう。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b3": {
    "text": "だれでも、…その人の家に押し入って家財を奪い取ることはできない。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b4": {
    "text": "まず強い人を縛りあげなければ、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b5": {
    "text": "縛ってからはじめて、その家を略奪することができる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b1": {
    "text": "よく言い聞かせておくが、人の子らには、その犯すすべての罪も神をけがす言葉も、ゆるされる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b2": {
    "text": "しかし、聖霊をけがす者は、いつまでもゆるされず、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b3": {
    "text": "永遠の罪に定められる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b4": {
    "text": "そう言われたのは、彼らが…と言っていたからである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b5": {
    "text": "イエスはけがれた霊につかれている",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b1": {
    "text": "さて、イエスの母と兄弟たちとがきて、外に立ち、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b2": {
    "text": "人をやってイエスを呼ばせた。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b3": {
    "text": "ときに、群衆はイエスを囲んですわっていたが、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b4": {
    "text": "…と言った。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b5": {
    "text": "ごらんなさい。あなたの母上と兄弟、姉妹たちが、外であなたを尋ねておられます",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b1": {
    "text": "すると、イエスは彼らに答えて言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b2": {
    "text": "わたしの母、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b3": {
    "text": "わたしの兄弟とは、だれのことか",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b4": {
    "text": "そして、自分をとりかこんで、すわっている人々を見まわして、言われた、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b5": {
    "text": "ごらんなさい、ここにわたしの母、わたしの兄弟がいる。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b6": {
    "text": "神のみこころを行う者はだれでも、",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b7": {
    "text": "わたしの兄弟、また姉妹、また母なのである。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "jpnkougo",
      "ref": "Mark 3:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
